C or PLC in St. Landry Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/st-landry-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the St. Landry Parish record runs from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, April to May came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years. In 2025, September to October came in at 58% of normal on the middle of the grids and October to November at 47%. Grid 12451 had its driest year in 1954 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
